      "performer":"",
      "lines":[
        {
          "n":"0",
          "text":"Okay, you're a goon, what's a goon with no profit?",
          "rhyme":"i",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"1",
          "text":"Broke as fuck, sittin' with a empty wallet (Ha-ha)",
          "rhyme":"E",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"2",
          "text":"One dude lemme come in, boy, I got this (Yeah)",
          "rhyme":"i",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"3",
          "text":"Everybody jumpin' around like it's a mosh pit (Mosh pit)",
          "rhyme":"i",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"4",
          "text":"I drop that hot shit (Hot shit), you drop nonsense (Nonsense)",
          "rhyme":"#s",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"5",
          "text":"And my money long like the center for the Rockets (Yeah)",
          "rhyme":"Et",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"6",
          "text":"I get that chronic, that Cali weed, roll a Swisher, pass to me",
          "rhyme":"@",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"7",
          "text":"Smash a beat, work of art, masterpiece (Uh-huh)",
          "rhyme":"is",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"8",
          "text":"Game on lock and key (Huh?), nobody stoppin' me (Chyeah)",
          "rhyme":"@",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"9",
          "text":"Got some haze and Patrón, 'bout to pop a bean (Haha)",
          "rhyme":"in",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"10",
          "text":"Now I'm rollin' like a sixteen-wheeler",
          "rhyme":"e",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"11",
          "text":"And my money fat like a sixteenth meal, bruh",
          "rhyme":"u",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"12",
          "text":"Your favorite rapper's favorite rapper (Favorite rapper)",
          "rhyme":"e",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"13",
          "text":"That's the game I'm after (Game I'm after)",
          "rhyme":"e",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"14",
