          "rhyme":"aft",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"9",
          "text":"Where you can find me posted up in my Gucci vest (Yeah)",
          "rhyme":"Est",
          "persona":"Mac_Miller"
        },
        {
          "n":"10",
          "text":"Boy, I'm gettin' paid (Paid), then I'm gettin' laid (Ha-ha)",
